  "sourceText": "Italian Potatoes\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 3, 2009 - 12:14am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/4 pound butter, (melted)\n1 tablespoon heaping parsley\n1/4 cup oil\n1 teaspoon crushed red peppers\n2 cloves, minced garlic\n1/4 cup parmesan cheese\n1 medium onion, chopped\n4 mediums potatoes,, (cut in quarters)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In casserole add butter, oil, garlic, onions and potatoes. Stir ingredients Sprinkle parsley, peppers, cheese and salt Bake 1 her at 350, might take longer. Potatoes should be crispy.",
